# Release Readiness Checklist

This checklist ensures predictable, low-risk releases across complex, cross-functional environments.

---

## 1. Release Overview

- **Release Name / ID:**
- **Target Release Date:**
- **Release Type:** (Feature / Platform / Infra / Hotfix)
- **Business Owner:**
- **Technical Owner:**
- **Rollback Owner:**

---

## 2. Scope Confirmation

- [ ] Final scope approved by Product & Engineering
- [ ] All in-scope features merged to release branch
- [ ] No unapproved scope changes pending
- [ ] Dependencies confirmed and documented

---

## 3. Engineering Readiness

- [ ] Code freeze completed
- [ ] All PRs reviewed and approved
- [ ] Feature flags validated (on/off scenarios tested)
- [ ] Build and deployment pipelines green
- [ ] Rollback plan documented and validated

---

## 4. Quality & Testing

- [ ] Functional testing completed
- [ ] Regression testing completed
- [ ] Performance testing completed (if applicable)
- [ ] UAT sign-off received
- [ ] Known issues documented with mitigation

---

## 5. Security & Compliance

- [ ] Security scans completed
- [ ] No critical or high vulnerabilities open
- [ ] Compliance approvals obtained (SOX / Audit / Regulatory if applicable)
- [ ] Data privacy checks completed

---

## 6. Operational Readiness

- [ ] Monitoring dashboards configured
- [ ] Alerts validated
- [ ] Runbooks updated
- [ ] On-call coverage confirmed
- [ ] Incident response plan reviewed

---

## 7. Go / No-Go Decision

**Release Status:**
- 🟢 Go
- 🟡 Conditional Go
- 🔴 No-Go

**Decision Notes:**
- Risks:
- Mitigations:
- Final Approver:

---

## 8. Post-Release Validation

- [ ] Production smoke tests passed
- [ ] KPIs / SLIs stable
- [ ] No Sev-1 / Sev-2 incidents
- [ ] Stakeholders notified
- [ ] Post-release review scheduled

---

